{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34176","headline":"杂讽九首 一 · 陆龟蒙","name":"杂讽九首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"红蚕缘枯桑，青茧大如瓮。\n人争捩其臂，羿矢亦不中。\n微微待贤禄，一一希入梦。\n纵操上吉言，口噤难即贡。\n蛟龙在怒水，拔取牙角弄。\n丹穴如可游，家家畜孤凤。\n凶门尚儿戏，战血波澒溶。\n社鬼苟有灵，谁能遏秋恸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34176.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34176","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}